<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Page Introuvable | Page Not Found</title>
<style>
.flex-container {
display: flex;
flex-direction: column;
width: 100%;
max-width: 1090px;
margin-left: auto;
margin-right: auto;
box-sizing: border-box;
}
.text-center {
text-align: center !important;
}
.page_404 { 
padding: 40px 0; 
background: #f0f0f0; 
font-family: "Roboto", sans-serif; 
height: 100vh;
}
.page_404 img { width: 100%; }
.four_zero_four_bg {
background-image: url(https://assets.restodata.ca/images/404-eat.gif);
height: 350px;
background-repeat: no-repeat;
background-size: contain;
background-position: center;
margin-top: -20px;
}
.four_zero_four_bg h1, .four_zero_four_bg h3 {
font-size: 80px;
}
p.copyright {
margin-top: 30px;
color: gray;
font-size: 15px;
}
.link_404 {      
background-color: #e54449;
background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff7a00, #ff0069, #cb3232);
color: #fff !important;
font-weight: 700;
letter-spacing: .1px;
border-radius: 35px !important;
display: inline-block;
font-size: 14px !important;
line-height: 1;
padding: 17px 9px !important;
text-align: center;
margin: 19px auto auto;
min-width: 315px;
text-decoration: none;
}
.contant_box_404 { margin-top: -50px; }
</style>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100vh;">
<section class="page_404">
<div class="flex-container">
<div class="text-center">
<div class="text-center">
<a href="https://www.restomontreal.ca">
<img src="https://assets.restomontreal.ca/logos/logo-sm.png?v3" width="150" style="margin-bottom:20px; width:150px!important;" alt="Restaurants">
</a>
</div>

<div class="four_zero_four_bg"></div>

<div class="contant_box_404">
<h3 class="h2">
Cette page a disparu / This page has gone missing
</h3>

<p>La page que vous recherchez n'est pas disponible ! / The page you're looking for is not available!</p>

<a href="https://www.restomontreal.ca" class="link_404">
Retour à / Back to: restomontreal.ca</a>

<p class="copyright">
&copy; 2026 Restomontreal</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</body>
</html>